      "finding": "The producer finalization-status loop checks its deadline and sleeps max(0.05, poll_seconds) before each subsequent status call.",
      "id": "producer_finalization_sleep",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/21c38f9cc56d/riverhog/packages/riverhog-client/src/riverhog_client/producer.py",
      "sha256": "d92fa6186abeee36ec2de028a548c4579ebb60b12cb796c20fe4bac1db638916",
      "start_line": 744
    },
    {
      "end_line": 789,
      "finding": "Custody draining uses the same deadline and sleeps only when a member remains waiting.",
      "id": "producer_custody_sleep",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/21c38f9cc56d/riverhog/packages/riverhog-client/src/riverhog_client/producer.py",
      "sha256": "d92fa6186abeee36ec2de028a548c4579ebb60b12cb796c20fe4bac1db638916",
      "start_line": 766
    },
    {
      "end_line": 607,
      "finding": "The seal endpoint is a synchronous function delegating to the Core service.",
      "id": "synchronous_seal_route",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/21c38f9cc56d/riverhog/riverhog/src/riverhog_api/routers/collections.py",
      "sha256": "137cc8d06d78c1e3e3707f9863b33b4a0f710518623c418121b8b31212f86078",
      "start_line": 598
    },
    {
      "end_line": 2127,
      "finding": "An active seal calls the stamped validation unit after its transaction; the stamp reads before and after one unit. Terminal states return earlier.",
      "id": "core_seal_and_stamped_unit",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/21c38f9cc56d/riverhog/riverhog/src/riverhog_core/services/collection_uploads.py",
      "sha256": "40bbee6baed4c66b27efb8aee2acf2e5ff75426dee788188ffd23df65a548aaf",
      "start_line": 2112
    },
    {
      "end_line": 2251,
      "finding": "The ordinary coordinator defaults to limit=1, selects warm/fresh candidates, and tries candidates sequentially until progress; this method does not fan out native work.",
      "id": "bounded_sequential_coordinator",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/21c38f9cc56d/riverhog/riverhog/src/riverhog_core/services/collection_uploads.py",
      "sha256": "40bbee6baed4c66b27efb8aee2acf2e5ff75426dee788188ffd23df65a548aaf",
      "start_line": 2209
    },
    {
      "end_line": 133,
      "finding": "The ordinary journal_validation_concurrency default is 2.",
      "id": "ordinary_journal_capacity",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/21c38f9cc56d/riverhog/riverhog/src/riverhog_core/runtime_config.py",
      "sha256": "a902d8256912fc1cdbe9f18905e155c5d9c794a34f97a54d9bf9a829fb73ddbb",
      "start_line": 131
    },
    {
      "end_line": 183,
      "finding": "for_testing installs dummy secrets and derives a SQLite workspace path; it leaves ordinary journal concurrency and Native budget defaults unless callers override them.",
      "id": "testing_defaults",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/21c38f9cc56d/riverhog/riverhog/src/riverhog_core/runtime_config.py",
      "sha256": "a902d8256912fc1cdbe9f18905e155c5d9c794a34f97a54d9bf9a829fb73ddbb",
      "start_line": 164
    },
    {
      "end_line": 63,
      "finding": "The source port requires current source/job-fence verification without scanning source contents and conveys no authority for client-supplied checkpoints or databases.",
      "id": "source_fence_contract",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/21c38f9cc56d/riverhog/packages/riverhog-provenance/src/riverhog_provenance/journal_session.py",
      "sha256": "8d3be9330aeb3e6fb7fd61c19d0d8fe7e1b83cffeb681521173c498b9a876118",
      "start_line": 45
    },
    {
      "end_line": 75,
      "finding": "The ordinary budget is rows=64, source_octets=65536, and octets=4*PROVENANCE_JOURNAL_ENTRY_BYTES_MAX+65536.",
      "id": "ordinary_native_budget",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/21c38f9cc56d/riverhog/packages/riverhog-provenance/src/riverhog_provenance/journal_session.py",
      "sha256": "8d3be9330aeb3e6fb7fd61c19d0d8fe7e1b83cffeb681521173c498b9a876118",
      "start_line": 66
    },
    {
      "end_line": 383,
      "finding": "Application lifespan creates archive, retrieval-restore and retrieval-cache tasks and cancels/awaits them during shutdown; an owned app container is then closed.",
      "id": "lifespan_starts_background_owners",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/21c38f9cc56d/riverhog/riverhog/src/riverhog_api/app.py",
      "sha256": "fb3776d921576a7ee8625837364c29fdf5305f792aea53e77c6dea27d092e1c0",
      "start_line": 343
    },
    {
      "end_line": 239,
      "finding": "The archive task begins with delay=0 and startup_recovery=True, then invokes maintenance through asyncio.to_thread under its operation lock.",
      "id": "initial_archive_sweep",
      "path": "/workspace/scratch/21c38f9cc56d/riverhog/riverhog/src/riverhog_api/app.py",
      "sha256": "fb3776d921576a7ee8625837364c29fdf5305f792aea53e77c6dea27d092e1c0",
      "start_line": 189
    },
    {
      "end_line": 185,
      "finding": "Full archive maintenance includes a provenance-journal validation turn and other ordinary owner work.",
      "id": "maintenance_journal_turn",
